{"surah":101,"ayahs":["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","مَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَارِعَةُ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَارِعَةُ","يَوْمَ يَكُونُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>اسُ كَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَرَاشِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">ثُو</span>ثِ","وَتَكُونُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِبَالُ كَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِهْنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">فُو</span>شِ","فَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن ثَ</span>قُلَتْ مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وَٰ</span>زِينُهُۥ","فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةٍ رَّ</span>اضِيَةٍ","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وَٰ</span>زِينُهُۥ","فَأُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مُّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> هَاوِيَةٌ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا هِيَهْ","نَارٌ حَامِيَةُۢ"]}